          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  ============================================================\n  LOREN – הזמנה מוקדמת + פופאפ — גרסה אמינה (Formspree)\n  ------------------------------------------------------------\n  קולט שם, טלפון, אימייל וכמות → דשבורד + מייל, ואפשר לחבר\n  ל-Google Sheet. שומר על העיצוב, ועובד תמיד.\n\n  הגדרה (פעם אחת, 2 דקות):\n  1. היכנסו ל-formspree.io → הרשמה חינם → New form.\n  2. העתיקו את כתובת ה-endpoint (נראית כך: https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz).\n  3. הדביקו אותה בשורה למטה במקום XXXXXXX.\n  4. שליחת הבדיקה הראשונה — Formspree ישלח לכם מייל לאישור\n     הטופס (פעם אחת בלבד). אשרו, וזהו — כל ליד נכנס.\n  * אפשר להחליף ל-Getform / Basin / Google Sheet — אותו רעיון.\n  ============================================================\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- comment -%} ←←← הדביקו כאן את ה-endpoint שלכם ←←← {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign lead_endpoint = \"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbx0JO87rm88DKm1XNByN1hDaEPIh3Pj6WwRhKGcjOjLrjdOk5EIfFdv-LOGwIG3RHX_Iw/exec\" -%}\n\n<div class=\"loren-po\" dir=\"rtl\">\n\n  <div class=\"loren-po__card\">\n    <span class=\"loren-po__badge\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M8 21h8M12 17v4M7 4h10v4a5 5 0 0 1-10 0zM7 4H4v2a3 3 0 0 0 3 3M17 4h3v2a3 3 0 0 1-3 3\"/></svg>\n      Sold Out · כמות מוגבלת\n    </span>\n    <p class=\"loren-po__title\">Sold Out (בפעם השלישית). מלאי חדש ומוגבל זמין כעת להזמנה מוקדמת.</p>\n    <p class=\"loren-po__sub\">תירשמו ותקבלו מתנה בשווי <b>79 ש״ח</b>.</p>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"loren-po__btn\" id=\"lorenPoOpen\">\n      שריינו מקום בהזמנה המוקדמת\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M15 6l-6 6 6 6\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <span class=\"loren-po__note\">✓ בלי התחייבות · ניצור קשר ראשונים כשנפתח</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"loren-po__modal\" id=\"lorenPoModal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <div class=\"loren-po__overlay\" data-po-close></div>\n    <div class=\"loren-po__box\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"lorenPoTitle\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"loren-po__x\" data-po-close aria-label=\"סגירה\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n\n      <div class=\"loren-po__content\" id=\"lorenPoContent\">\n      <span class=\"loren-po__badge loren-po__badge--sm\">מהדורת בכורה · קבלו מתנה בשווי 79₪</span>\n      <h3 class=\"loren-po__mtitle\" id=\"lorenPoTitle\">שריון מקום בהזמנה המוקדמת</h3>\n      <p class=\"loren-po__mdesc\">השאירו פרטים ונעדכן אתכם ראשונים כשההזמנה המוקדמת נפתחת עם ההנחה שמורה על שמכם.</p>\n\n      <form class=\"loren-po__form\" id=\"lorenPoForm\" action=\"{{ lead_endpoint }}\" method=\"POST\">\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_subject\" value=\"ליד הזמנה מוקדמת — LOREN\">\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"מקור\" value=\"preorder-loren\">\n\n        <label class=\"loren-po__field\">\n          <span>שם מלא</span>\n          <input type=\"text\" name=\"שם מלא\" required placeholder=\"השם שלכם\">\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"loren-po__field\">\n          <span>טלפון</span>\n          <input type=\"tel\" name=\"טלפון\" required placeholder=\"050-0000000\">\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"loren-po__field\">\n          <span>אימייל</span>\n          <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required placeholder=\"you@email.com\">\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"loren-po__field\">\n          <span>כמה קופסאות מעניין אתכם?</span>\n          <select name=\"כמות קופסאות\">\n            <option>עדיין לא בטוח/ה</option>\n            <option>1 קופסה</option>\n            <option>2 קופסאות</option>\n            <option>3 קופסאות ומעלה</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"loren-po__submit\" id=\"lorenPoSubmit\">אני רוצה לשמור לי מקום</button>\n        <span class=\"loren-po__mini\">הפרטים נשמרים אצלנו בלבד. בלי ספאם, בלי חיוב.</span>\n      </form>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"loren-po__success\" id=\"lorenPoSuccess\" hidden>\n        <strong>תודה! שריינו לכם מקום 🎉</strong>\n        נעדכן אתכם ראשונים כשההזמנה המוקדמת נפתחת.\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"loren-po__error\" id=\"lorenPoError\" hidden>אופס — משהו השתבש. בדקו את הפרטים ונסו שוב.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .loren-po {\n    --po-accent: #2f5fd6; --po-gold: #b8860b; --po-gold-bg: #fbf1d8;\n    --po-text: #1c2430; --po-sub: #5b6b7a;\n    font-family: inherit; max-width: 560px; margin: 16px auto 8px; padding: 0 12px;\n  }\n  .loren-po *, .loren-po *::before, .loren-po *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n  .loren-po__card {\n    text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f7faff 0%, #eef4ff 100%);\n    border: 1.5px solid rgba(47, 95, 214, .18); border-radius: 18px; padding: 18px 18px 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(40, 70, 130, .09);\n  }\n  .loren-po__badge {\n    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px;\n    background: var(--po-gold-bg); color: var(--po-gold);\n    font-size: clamp(11px, 3vw, 12.5px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .02em;\n  }\n  .loren-po__badge svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; }\n  .loren-po__badge--sm { margin-bottom: 6px; }\n\n  .loren-po__title { margin: 11px 0 4px; font-size: clamp(16px, 4.2vw, 20px); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--po-text); }\n  .loren-po__title b { color: var(--po-accent); }\n  .loren-po__sub { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: clamp(13px, 3.4vw, 14.5px); color: var(--po-sub); line-height: 1.5; }\n\n  .loren-po__btn {\n    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;\n    width: 100%; max-width: 420px; padding: 15px 20px; border: none; border-radius: 14px; cursor: pointer;\n    background: var(--po-accent); color: #fff; font-family: inherit; font-size: clamp(15px, 4vw, 17px); font-weight: 800;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(47, 95, 214, .32); transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, background .15s ease;\n  }\n  .loren-po__btn svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }\n  .loren-po__btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(47, 95, 214, .4); background: #2a55c2; }\n  .loren-po__btn:active { transform: translateY(0); }\n  .loren-po__note { display: block; margin-top: 10px; font-size: clamp(11px, 3vw, 12.5px); color: var(--po-sub); }\n\n  .loren-po__modal {\n    --po-accent: #2f5fd6; --po-gold: #b8860b; --po-gold-bg: #fbf1d8; --po-text: #1c2430; --po-sub: #5b6b7a;\n    font-family: inherit; position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 99999;\n    display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 18px;\n  }\n  .loren-po__modal.is-open { display: flex; }\n  .loren-po__overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(15, 24, 45, .55); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(3px); backdrop-filter: blur(3px); }\n  .loren-po__box {\n    position: relative; z-index: 1; width: 100%; max-width: 420px;\n    max-height: calc(100vh - 36px); max-height: calc(100dvh - 36px);\n    overflow-y: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n    background: #fff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 26px 22px 22px;\n    box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(10, 20, 45, .4); text-align: center; animation: loren-po-in .22s ease;\n  }\n  @keyframes loren-po-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }\n  .loren-po__x {\n    position: sticky; top: -2px; float: left; margin: -8px -6px 0 0;\n    width: 34px; height: 34px; border: none; border-radius: 50%; background: #f1f4f9; color: #4a5568; cursor: pointer;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 2;\n  }\n  .loren-po__x svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }\n  .loren-po__x:hover { background: #e6eaf1; }\n  .loren-po__mtitle { margin: 6px 0 6px; font-size: clamp(19px, 5vw, 23px); font-weight: 800; color: var(--po-text); }\n  .loren-po__mdesc { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: clamp(13px, 3.4vw, 14.5px); color: var(--po-sub); line-height: 1.55; }\n\n  .loren-po__form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 11px; text-align: right; }\n  .loren-po__field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }\n  .loren-po__field span { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--po-text); }\n  .loren-po__field input, .loren-po__field select {\n    width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1.5px solid #dfe4ec; border-radius: 11px;\n    font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; color: var(--po-text); background: #fff; transition: border-color .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;\n  }\n  .loren-po__field input:focus, .loren-po__field select:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--po-accent); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(47, 95, 214, .14); }\n\n  .loren-po__submit {\n    margin-top: 4px; padding: 15px; border: none; border-radius: 13px; cursor: pointer;\n    background: var(--po-accent); color: #fff; font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(47, 95, 214, .3); transition: transform .15s ease, background .15s ease, opacity .15s ease;\n  }\n  .loren-po__submit:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); background: #2a55c2; }\n  .loren-po__submit[disabled] { opacity: .6; cursor: default; }\n  .loren-po__mini { display: block; text-align: center; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--po-sub); }\n\n  .loren-po__success { background: #eaf7ee; border: 1px solid #bfe6cb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; font-size: 15px; color: #1f7a3d; line-height: 1.5; }\n  .loren-po__success strong { display: block; font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .loren-po__error { background: #fdecec; border: 1px solid #f5c2c2; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 13px; font-size: 13.5px; color: #c0392b; margin: 8px 0 0; text-align: center; }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    var modal = document.getElementById('lorenPoModal');\n    var openBtn = document.getElementById('lorenPoOpen');\n    if (!modal || !openBtn) return;\n    if (modal.parentNode !== document.body) { document.body.appendChild(modal); }\n\n    var form = modal.querySelector('#lorenPoForm');\n    var submit = modal.querySelector('#lorenPoSubmit');\n    var okMsg = modal.querySelector('#lorenPoSuccess');\n    var errMsg = modal.querySelector('#lorenPoError');\n\n    function open() { modal.classList.add('is-open'); modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false'); document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden'; }\n    function close() { modal.classList.remove('is-open'); modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true'); document.body.style.overflow = ''; }\n\n    openBtn.addEventListener('click', open);\n    modal.querySelectorAll('[data-po-close]').forEach(function (el) { el.addEventListener('click', close); });\n    document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) { if (e.key === 'Escape' && modal.classList.contains('is-open')) close(); });\n\n    if (form) {\n      form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        if (errMsg) errMsg.hidden = true;\n        submit.disabled = true; submit.textContent = 'שולח…';\n        var params = new URLSearchParams(new FormData(form));\n        fetch(form.action, { method: 'POST', body: params, mode: 'no-cors' })\n          .then(function () {\n            var content = modal.querySelector('#lorenPoContent');\n            if (content) content.style.display = 'none';\n            if (okMsg) { okMsg.hidden = false; okMsg.style.display = 'block'; }\n          })\n          .catch(function () {\n            if (errMsg) errMsg.hidden = false;\n            submit.disabled = false; submit.textContent = 'שריינו לי מקום + 20% הנחה';\n          });\n      });\n    }\n  })();\n</script>"
