            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"loren-benefits\" dir=\"rtl\">\n  <ul class=\"loren-benefits__grid\">\n    <li class=\"loren-benefits__item\">\n      <span class=\"loren-benefits__ic\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 4 13C4 8 8 4 20 4c0 8-4 12-9 12z\"/><path d=\"M4 20c3-6 7-8.5 12-9.5\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span>100% טבעי</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"loren-benefits__item\">\n      <span class=\"loren-benefits__ic\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M8 3l4 2 4-2 4 3-2.5 2.7L16 8v12H8V8l-1.5.7L4 6z\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span>על הבגד, לא על העור</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"loren-benefits__item\">\n      <span class=\"loren-benefits__ic\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8-7 10-4-2-7-5.5-7-10V6z\"/><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span>בטוח מגיל 0</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"loren-benefits__item\">\n      <span class=\"loren-benefits__ic\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3.5 2\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span>עד 8 שעות הגנה</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"loren-benefits__item\">\n      <span class=\"loren-benefits__ic\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3s6 6.5 6 11a6 6 0 0 1-12 0c0-4.5 6-11 6-11z\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span>עמיד במים וזיעה</span>\n    </li>\n    <li class=\"loren-benefits__item\">\n      <span class=\"loren-benefits__ic\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M5.6 5.6l12.8 12.8\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span>ללא כימיקלים</span>\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<style>\n  .loren-benefits {\n    --lb-accent: #2fa84f;\n    --lb-text: #2a3648;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    margin: 16px auto 8px;\n    padding: 0 12px;\n  }\n  .loren-benefits *,\n  .loren-benefits *::before,\n  .loren-benefits *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n  .loren-benefits__grid {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);   /* נייד: 2 עמודות שוות */\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  @media (min-width: 520px) {\n    .loren-benefits__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } /* מחשב: 3 */\n  }\n\n  .loren-benefits__item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    padding: 8px 11px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(50, 80, 120, .1);\n    border-radius: 13px;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(50, 80, 120, .06);\n    font-size: clamp(12px, 3.2vw, 13.5px);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    color: var(--lb-text);\n    min-height: 40px;\n  }\n  .loren-benefits__ic {\n    flex: none;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: rgba(47, 168, 79, .12);\n    color: var(--lb-accent);\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .loren-benefits__ic svg { width: 15px; height: 15px; display: block; }\n</style>"
